 "summary": "The new declarations build on existing API: `extendsDisjointOpens_of_continuousOn`, `HasHomotopyExtensionProperty.exists_retraction`, `t2Space_of_isColimit` with `TransfiniteCompositionOfShape.mem_incl_app`, `ContinuousMap.liftCoherent` and `cofibrationTowerHomotopyEquiv`. Neither TauCeti nor Mathlib has a lemma that makes a coherent union a `TopCat` colimit, and the PR removes duplication by moving the HEP-preimage proof into a general lemma and replacing the inline argument in `Proper.lean`.",
